Create a radius three anti-teleport field for [6, 7, 8, 9, 10 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] turns and daze all enemies in the area of effect for two turns.

Enemies attempting to teleport while anchored take [70, 94, 113, 129, 143 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] physical and [70, 94, 113, 129, 143 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] temporal (warp) damage.

The damage will scale with your Spellpower.
